    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d586">

                <pb facs="1031" n="931" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg931"/>

                <head>No. 586.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Mendez de
                            Vigo to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain at Washington</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 26,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of His Catholic
                    Majesty, referring to the conference which he had the pleasure to have this
                    morning with Mr. John Hay, has the honor herewith to transmit to the honorable
                    Secretary of State of the United States a copy of a royal order, bearing date of
                    the 27th of May last, which he has just received from his government, with
                    instructions to communicate it to the Washington cabinet.</p>
                <p>The undersigned begs the Hon. William M. Evarts, if, as he confidently hopes, the
                    President shares the view of the Spanish Government, whose sole object is the
                    avoidance of those conflicts of jurisdiction which frequently occur in the case
                    of collisions of vessels carrying different <pb facs="1032" n="932"
                        xml:id="pg932"/> flags, to be pleased so to inform the undersigned, who
                    gladly avails himself of this occasion once more to reiterate to him the
                    assurances of his very high consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>FELIPE MENDEZ <hi rendition="#small-caps">de</hi>
                    VIGO.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d586-a1.xml" xpointer="d586-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
